Third-party components in the Android app (apps/android)

The Android app includes the FFmpeg audio decoder for AndroidX Media3 as built
and published by the Jellyfin project (org.jellyfin.media3:media3-ffmpeg-decoder),
under the GNU General Public License v3.0, with FFmpeg under its own license.
Source: https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-androidx-media and https://ffmpeg.org.
The GPL v3 and the AGPL v3 that covers VideoCAT allow combining both (section 13
of each license).
